ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi019: OPEN_SHELL with one ADVANCED_FACE on a CYLINDRICAL_SURFACE (radius 1, height 2); FACE_OUTER_BOUND references an EDGE_LOOP with two half-circumference arcs and one full-period closed CIRCLE edge (start==end vertex) acting as the seam; plus two bottom edges, totalling >=4 EDGE_CURVEs; full-period EDGE_CURVE with start==end vertex IS the mechanism — the seam edge wraps 360° without being split; defect edge IS wired into EDGE_LOOP, FACE_OUTER_BOUND, ADVANCED_FACE, OPEN_SHELL; kernel must split closed edge at seam parameter into two open arcs */
